Package: bdynets
Title: Bayesian Dynamic Network Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sheng", "Jiang", , "jiangsheng@cuhk.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Modular tools for Bayesian analysis of network-associated time
    series. Provides graph-informed mixtures of static Gaussian experts with
    adaptive graph guidance and posterior partition summaries, alongside the
    existing experimental dynamic count-mixture sampler and clustering utilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    graphics,
    magrittr,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    BayesLogit,
    beepr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
